              <h2 style="font-size:21px;color:#0b3a6e;margin:0 0 13px;">3. Deployment esclusivo</h2>
              <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 12px;">Dalla cartella principale del repository eseguire il comando seguente. La command line è intenzionalmente mantenuta su una singola riga.</p>
              <div class="command-line" style="width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:5px;padding:16px 18px;margin:0 0 22px;overflow-x:auto;white-space:nowrap;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;"><span style="color:#79c0ff;">.\deploy.ps1</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-ResourceGroupName</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff;">'&lt;RESOURCE-GROUP&gt;'</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-Location</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff;">'&lt;REGIONE&gt;'</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-TenantId</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff;">'&lt;TENANT-ID&gt;'</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-SubscriptionId</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff;">'&lt;SUBSCRIPTION-ID&gt;'</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-RunbookSelection</span> <span style="color:#ffa657;">ExtensionAttribute</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-GrantGraphPermissions</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-StartExtensionAttributeJobNow</span></div>

              <div style="background:#fff4e5;border:1px solid #f0c36d;border-left:6px solid #d97706;padding:17px 20px;margin:0 0 26px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;">
                <strong>Deployment in delta.</strong> <code>RunbookSelection ExtensionAttribute</code> distribuisce o aggiorna soltanto il secondo runbook e preserva GroupSync, la sua schedule, i webhook, le identità assegnate, l'accesso di rete e le permission esistenti. Utilizzare <code>RunbookSelection All</code> solo quando si desidera aggiornare entrambi i runbook. La rimozione dei componenti non selezionati avviene esclusivamente aggiungendo lo switch esplicito <code>-FullReconcile</code>.
              </div>

              <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>Aggiornamento completo:</strong> per aggiornare entrambi i runbook utilizzare il comando seguente.</p>
              <div class="command-line" style="width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:5px;padding:16px 18px;margin:0 0 26px;overflow-x:auto;white-space:nowrap;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;"><span style="color:#79c0ff;">.\deploy.ps1</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-ResourceGroupName</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff;">'&lt;RESOURCE-GROUP&gt;'</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-Location</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff;">'&lt;REGIONE&gt;'</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-TenantId</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff;">'&lt;TENANT-ID&gt;'</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-SubscriptionId</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff;">'&lt;SUBSCRIPTION-ID&gt;'</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-RunbookSelection</span> <span style="color:#ffa657;">All</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-GrantGraphPermissions</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-StartExtensionAttributeJobNow</span></div>

              <h2 style="font-size:21px;color:#0b3a6e;margin:0 0 13px;">4. Permission Microsoft Graph</h2>
              <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 14px;">Per la selezione ExtensionAttribute, alla Managed Identity vengono assegnate esclusivamente le permission applicative necessarie:</p>
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width:100%;table-layout:fixed;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 18px;font-size:14px;">
                <tr style="background:#edf4fb;"><td style="padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe3ec;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-weight:600;">DeviceManagementManagedDevices.Read.All</td><td style="padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe3ec;">Lettura dello stato di cifratura dei device gestiti da Intune.</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:11px 14px;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-weight:600;">Device.ReadWrite.All</td><td style="padding:11px 14px;">Lettura dei device Entra e aggiornamento dell'extension attribute.</td></tr>
              </table>
              <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 12px;color:#52606d;">Durante il deployment viene richiesto un login amministrativo tramite device code. Completare l'autenticazione nel browser entro il tempo indicato dalla console.</p>
              <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 12px;">Se le permission sono già state assegnate e verificate separatamente, utilizzare:</p>
              <div class="command-line" style="width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:5px;padding:16px 18px;margin:0 0 26px;overflow-x:auto;white-space:nowrap;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;"><span style="color:#79c0ff;">.\deploy.ps1</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-ResourceGroupName</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff;">'&lt;RESOURCE-GROUP&gt;'</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-Location</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff;">'&lt;REGIONE&gt;'</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-TenantId</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff;">'&lt;TENANT-ID&gt;'</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-SubscriptionId</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff;">'&lt;SUBSCRIPTION-ID&gt;'</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-RunbookSelection</span> <span style="color:#ffa657;">ExtensionAttribute</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-PermissionsConfirmed</span> <span style="color:#d2a8ff;">-StartExtensionAttributeJobNow</span></div>

              <h2 style="font-size:21px;color:#0b3a6e;margin:0 0 13px;">5. Automation Variables</h2>
              <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 14px;">Il deployment crea le variabili seguenti solo se non esistono già. I valori presenti vengono preservati nei deployment successivi.</p>
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width:100%;table-layout:fixed;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 26px;font-size:14px;">
                <tr style="background:#0b3a6e;color:#ffffff;"><th align="left" style="padding:11px 14px;border-right:1px solid #315b87;">Automation Variable</th><th align="left" style="padding:11px 14px;border-right:1px solid #315b87;">Valore iniziale</th><th align="left" style="padding:11px 14px;">Utilizzo</th></tr>
                <tr style="background:#f8fafc;"><td style="padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #dbe3ec;font-family:Consolas,monospace;">BitLockerExtensionAttributeName</td><td style="padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #dbe3ec;"><code>extensionAttribute10</code></td><td style="padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #dbe3ec;">Nome dell'attributo Entra gestito.</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #dbe3ec;font-family:Consolas,monospace;">BitLockerExtensionAttributeEncryptedValue</td><td style="padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #dbe3ec;"><code>enc</code></td><td style="padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #dbe3ec;">Valore associato a un device cifrato.</td></tr>
                <tr style="background:#f8fafc;"><td style="padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #dbe3ec;font-family:Consolas,monospace;">BitLockerExtensionAttributeNotEncryptedValue</td><td style="padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #dbe3ec;"><code>notenc</code></td><td style="padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #dbe3ec;">Valore associato a un device non cifrato.</td></tr>
              </table>

              <h2 style="font-size:21px;color:#0b3a6e;margin:0 0 13px;">6. Verifiche finali</h2>
              <ol style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 24px;padding-left:24px;">
                <li>Il runbook risulta <strong>Published</strong> con runtime <strong>PowerShell 7.2</strong>.</li>
                <li>La schedule è abilitata e collegata al runbook.</li>
                <li>Le tre Automation Variables contengono i valori concordati e non sono cifrate.</li>
                <li>La Managed Identity dispone delle due permission Microsoft Graph indicate.</li>
                <li>Il primo job termina con stato <strong>Completed</strong>.</li>
                <li>I device Entra mostrano <code>extensionAttribute10</code> valorizzato con <code>enc</code> o <code>notenc</code>.</li>
                <li>Il workbook v2 visualizza KPI, trend, distribuzione valori, anomalie e dettaglio aggiornamenti.</li>
              </ol>

              <div style="background:#fdecec;border:1px solid #efb3b3;border-left:6px solid #b42318;padding:17px 20px;margin:0 0 26px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;">
                <strong>Sicurezza.</strong> Non trasmettere tramite email password, client secret, certificati PFX, URL webhook o altre credenziali. Utilizzare esclusivamente il canale sicuro concordato.
